    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We should be careful. You need a distraction, and I’m okay being that because I’m not looking for anything serious eithe",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1368
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "In some ways, I’m numb and just going through the motions. When I’m with you, I quit thinking about all the hard stuff. ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1924
        }
      ],
      "words": 26
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Maybe a little. But it’s okay. It really is.” She curled her arm around my neck and kissed the corner of my mouth",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2451
